{"id":"9dc79b4dfd8280cb","group":"67","path":"67/67-lem-pi1-interpretation.md","title":"Pi1 Sentences Forced by Interpretability","display":"lem-pi1-interpretation — Pi1 Sentences Forced by Interpretability","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-lem-pi1-interpretation","aliases":["67-lem-pi1-interpretation"],"display":"lem-pi1-interpretation — Pi1 Sentences Forced by Interpretability","depends_on":["[[67-df-interpretability]]","[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]","[[67-df-reflexive-theory]]","[[67-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]]","[[67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions]]"],"source_scope":"第 6 章 §1，Lemma 1，印刷页 77；PDF 第 88 页","verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","source_proof_status":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"inherited_verification_status":"source-statement-checked","inherited_source_proof_status":"已核对原书短证明；有限一致性转移及可证 Sigma1 完备性仍采用原书标准算术化事实","machine_verified":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-lem-pi1-interpretation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-lem-pi1-interpretation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-pi1-interpretation — Pi1 Sentences Forced by Interpretability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" href=\"?note=44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" title=\"67-df-interpretability\">67-df-interpretability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5c333dbc176d20e8\" href=\"?note=5c333dbc176d20e8\" title=\"67-df-reflexive-theory\">67-df-reflexive-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"824fdc45d800b7dd\" href=\"?note=824fdc45d800b7dd\" title=\"67-df-robinson-arithmetic\">67-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5fa3acf328238c71\" href=\"?note=5fa3acf328238c71\" title=\"67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions\">67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"第 6 章 §1，Lemma 1，印刷页 77；PDF 第 88 页"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"已核对原书短证明；有限一致性转移及可证 Sigma1 完备性仍采用原书标准算术化事实"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 是一致、原始递归公理集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq T\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq T\\)</span>，采用本册固定算术化。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"824fdc45d800b7dd\" href=\"?note=824fdc45d800b7dd\" title=\"67-df-robinson-arithmetic\">67-df-robinson-arithmetic</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\Pi_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(\\pi\\in\\Pi_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\unlhd\">\\(\\unlhd\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" href=\"?note=44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" title=\"67-df-interpretability\">67-df-interpretability</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本条的句法编号精确取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=c_L\">\\(g=c_L\\)</span>（算术语言时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=L_A\">\\(L=L_A\\)</span>）；数词代入取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"5fa3acf328238c71\" href=\"?note=5fa3acf328238c71\" title=\"67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions\">67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions</a> 的对应程序，图公式使用同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q\\cup\\{\\pi\\}\\unlhd T\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ T\\vdash\\pi.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q\\cup\\{\\pi\\}\\unlhd T\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ T\\vdash\\pi.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本节保留的原书页码、既往核对记录及证明说明来自输入档案；本次未提供原书 PDF，以下既往记录不表示本次重新完成了来源或证明核验。</p>\n<p>由于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q+\\pi\">\\(Q+\\pi\\)</span> 有限，某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\upharpoonright k\">\\(T\\upharpoonright k\\)</span> 已解释它。原书 Corollary 1 将有限解释算术化为一致性转移，反身性给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_{Q+\\pi}\">\\(T\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_{Q+\\pi}\\)</span>。又因 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\pi\">\\(\\neg\\pi\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>，可证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 完备性给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\neg\\pi\\to\\neg\\mathrm{Con}_{Q+\\pi}\">\\(T\\vdash\\neg\\pi\\to\\neg\\mathrm{Con}_{Q+\\pi}\\)</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\pi\">\\(T\\vdash\\pi\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>这一引理要求目标是 PA 扩张；对任意仅一致的算术理论不作相同承诺。已核对 PDF 第 88 页图像和该段完整证明，但未另行重建有限一致性转移的机器证明。</p>\n<p>来源：Per Lindström, <em>Aspects of Incompleteness</em>，原档案所引 Cambridge/ASL 2016 重印本 PDF；第 6 章 §1，Lemma 1，印刷页 77；PDF 第 88 页。</p>\n<p>证明核验范围：已核对原书短证明；有限一致性转移及可证 Sigma1 完备性仍采用原书标准算术化事实。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-interpretability","status":"resolved","id":"44cd21d3d12e4d8d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-interpretability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-reflexive-theory","status":"resolved","id":"5c333dbc176d20e8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-reflexive-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"824fdc45d800b7dd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-strong-godel-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"a329235da6144513","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions","status":"resolved","id":"5fa3acf328238c71","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"",