","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\unlhd","display":false},{"tex":"g=c_L","display":false},{"tex":"L=L_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\cup\\{\\pi\\}\\unlhd T\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ T\\vdash\\pi.","display":true},{"tex":"Q+\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"T\\upharpoonright k","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_{Q+\\pi}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash\\neg\\pi\\to\\neg\\mathrm{Con}_{Q+\\pi}","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash\\pi","display":false}],"bytes":2695,"backlinks":[{"id":"66d369f34bec0254","anchor":"ref-20","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$Q$ 和 $\\unlhd$ 采用 [[67-lem-pi1-interpretation]] 的接口；第二不完备性所用条件按 [[67-thm-godel-second-incompleteness]] 的 BL 接口展开，其对当前 $\\mathrm{Prov}_\\tau$ 的应用取 [[67-thm-lob]] 的 $\\varphi=\\neg(0=0)$ 实例。"},{"id":"8b478f37907667f0","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"来源证明已读。右到左：$A$ 反身，故各 $\\mathrm{Con}_{A\\upharpoonright k}$ 在 $A$ 中可证；它们是 $\\Pi_1$，所以在 $B$ 中可证，再用 Orey–Hájek。左到右：对 $A\\vdash\\pi$，有 $Q+\\pi\\unlhd B$；[[67-lem-pi1-interpretation]]（Lemma 1）用有限一致性转移、反身性和可证 $\\Sigma_1$ 完备性推出 $B\\vdash\\pi$。"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-188","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-lem-pi1-interpretation]]"}],"outgoing":["44cd21d3d12e4d8d","851cd80e64893935","5c333dbc176d20e8","824fdc45d800b7dd","a329235da6144513","5fa3acf328238c71"]}